### Health
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

### Search courses
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/courses/search?keyword=kubernetes&page=0&size=20

### Create course
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/courses
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_WITH_ADMIN_OR_INSTRUCTOR_ROLE>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kubernetes Masterclass",
  "description": "Complete K8s training",
  "category": "devops",
  "level": "ADVANCED",
  "tags": ["kubernetes", "docker", "devops"]
}

### Add module
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/courses/1/modules
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_WITH_ADMIN_OR_INSTRUCTOR_ROLE>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Introduction",
  "sequence": 1
}

### Add lesson
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/courses/modules/1/lessons
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_WITH_ADMIN_OR_INSTRUCTOR_ROLE>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Introduction to Kubernetes",
  "videoUrl": "",
  "duration": 25
}

### Get course
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/courses/1
